36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The all-in rate means I pay for appetites I do not have. Last year’s separate rooms varied by eight thousand yen. I need a single, predictable bill.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Midori,,"I found that last year we barely met, yet the shared house left me nowhere to be alone. I need a place that balances togetherness with space.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The ferry eats two full days. The train takes ninety minutes. I need to know which option preserves the most actual time.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I found the inn has one shared bathroom and fixed meal times. I worry about the cold water and the strict schedule.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, wait! If we rent the whole house, it’s one bill split evenly. No one pays extra for eating less!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, that is precisely the point. A single, even bill removes the uncertainty I dread. I am leaning toward the house option.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Sakura, that even bill is appealing. But the house meant no privacy for me. I need a place where we are together, yet I can still breathe.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Sakura, the house bill is even, but the ferry still costs two days. I cannot trade that for a single invoice.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Midori, the city room has a door and no timetable. That sounds much safer for me than the shared bath.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Toshio, two days is a lot! But if the house is cheap, maybe we can just stay longer?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the travel cost is real, but the financial risk of separate bookings is worse. I need the certainty of one bill.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Toshio, I hear you. But last year’s separation hurt. I need us together, yet with room to breathe. A town with streets might offer that balance.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The city trains run every few minutes, so I move without waiting. The spa bus stops early, which restricts my evening. I prefer the city’s flexibility.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
